  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.<br>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.<br>• Cook potato in boiling water over high heat until easily pierced with a fork, <br>12-15 mins.<br>• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk and butter and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86a5a4264524ca979dfae/step-ad012500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and garlic. Drain and rinse lentils. Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot, onion, lentils and zucchini until softened, 5-6 mins.<br>• Reduce heat to medium-low, then add garlic, Persian spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.<br>• Stir in coconut milk, the water and stock powder and cook, stirring, until <br>combined, 2-3 mins. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86a5a4264524ca979dfae/step-90618710.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to high. <br>• Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish and spread evenly with mash.<br>• Drizzle with olive oil and grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86a5a4264524ca979dfae/step-d2451020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide Persian lentil and veggie pie between plates.<br>• Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86a5a4264524ca979dfae/step-deb22f30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
